{"step_index":791,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T00:29:39Z","thinking":"The data reveals significant missing values in the '24년 매출액(원)' (Q) and '25년 매출액(원)' (R) columns, with a large number of 'None' entries. Non-zero values exist in both columns, with some zero values and a few instances of unexpected data types (empty strings/text) in the Q column. The filename itself might provide further context.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import urllib.request\nimport re\nimport sys\n\nsys.stdout.reconfigure(encoding='utf-8')\n\n# Check articles for sales revenue\narticles = [\"1028111670\", \"7738601800\", \"1068186950\", \"3688701231\", \"5288800923\"]\n\nfor art in articles:\n    url = f\"https://bizno.net/article/{art}\"\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers={\"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0\"})\n    try:\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=5) as resp:\n            html = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\n            m_title = re.search(r'<title>(.*?)</title>', html)\n            title = m_title.group(1).replace('- 비즈노', '').strip() if m_title else art\n            \n            # search for 매출\n            sales = re.findall(r'([^<>\\n]{0,30}매출[^<>\\n]{0,50})', html)\n            print(f\"\\n--- {title} ({art}) ---\")\n            for s in sales[:5]:\n                print(f\"  {s.strip()}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"Error {art}: {e}\")\n","Description":"Check sales revenue fields on bizno articles","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\cc5f8116-f40f-4d66-a990-d85efe7bc64f\\scratch\\check_bizno_sales.py","toolAction":"Writing check bizno sales script","toolSummary":"Write check_bizno_sales.py"}}]}
